A '''12-series speeder''' was a type of [[speeder]] that was not commonly known for its durability or speed. However, when modified, the speeder was more than qualified to participate in [[Riot Racing]]. It was put to the test when a [[droid]] known as [[TAY-0]] used a highly modified model in Riot Racing on [[Serolonis]].<ref name="Faster" />

